{
  "name": "dsh-style-detector",
  "version": "0.1.1",
  "description": "AI 文风检测器：本地规则引擎实时打分与定位，支持「通用」与「网文」两种文体（词表、权重、复审提示词各不相同），语义复审默认自动交给当前默认大模型，结论并入同一份诊断与改写建议，分数始终由本地算。另有重点排序、忽略已确认项、自定义词表、句长节奏、目标分、段落热力、两版对比与整章批量；复审用的模型可以从已绑定的 provider 目录里换，只影响本面板。错字校对单开一页：内置两百多条固定错配表即时标红，也可让模型逐句再挑形近字与成语误用，不影响文风分数。设置可一键导出导入；批量页带章节趋势。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "dsh-style-detector contributors",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/grq6414-hash/dsh-style-detector.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/grq6414-hash/dsh-style-detector#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/grq6414-hash/dsh-style-detector/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "cordis",
    "中文写作",
    "文风检测",
    "AI味",
    "网文",
    "小说",
    "错别字",
    "校对"
  ],
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.2"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar-right"
      ]
    }
  }
}
